@segment 13-15 Dalaran, Stormwind, Moonglade & Loch Modan I
@start-level 13
# Added 2026-11-11 from the Questie audit (tools/questie_near.py): 93963 Exploring the Alliance (Bolvar, Skyborne only): Randal Emerson here, King Magni and
# Mekkatorque in Ironforge in this segment, Tyrande in Darnassus on the Cat Form trip (segment 09), hand-in at Bolvar in
# segment 11. The objective numbers (1 Emerson, 2 Mekkatorque, 3 Magni, 4 Tyrande) are the order on its ForeverChanges page.
@carry 94946
@done 93089,94638
# Skyborne Druid 13-15: the bridge from Zephras Isle onto the shared Alliance path.
# Skycutter to Dalaran -> Skyborne Portal to Stormwind (Bolvar) -> Stormwind (bind, Sheldras Moontree) ->
# Teleport: Moonglade (Dendrite Starblaze, trainer, flight path) -> hearth to Stormwind -> Deeprun Tram ->
# Ironforge (flight path) -> on foot through east Dun Morogh and the South Gate Pass -> Loch Modan:
# Valley of Kings, Stonesplinter Valley, Thelsamar (flight path), north Loch (Stormpike, Silver Stream Mine).
# The Loch Modan part is the Dwarf Shaman route's first Loch Modan visit without its dwarf-only and shaman
# quests (413/414 from Dun Morogh, the 6387 gryphon chain, Call of Fire). It ends in Thelsamar: the next
# segment starts with the gryphon to Ironforge, exactly like the Dwarf route.
# Druid quests: 94912 Child of Nature (Alfina Nightgaze, Dalaran -> Sheldras Moontree, Stormwind) ->
# 94914 Moonglade (-> Dendrite Starblaze). Positions from the ForeverChanges pages.
# The hearthstone was last used at the end of the Zephras segment before the shrine and forest loops, so it
# is ready for the trip back from Moonglade.
# Carry-out: 263 (Stonesplinter Shamans and Bonesnappers, next Loch visit), 1338 Stormpike's Order
# (Stormwind, next segment), 2039 Find Bingles.

# --- Dalaran ---
T 94946 @ Alterac Mountains, 12.4, 56.3 | Danaaris Stargale meets you where the skycutter lands in Dalaran
A 94947 @ Alterac Mountains, 12.4, 56.3 | Danaaris Stargale
A 94912 @ Alterac Mountains, 11.8, 56.6 | Alfina Nightgaze, a few steps from Danaaris: your druid quest (needs level 10)
N Take the Skyborne Portal to Stormwind | The Kirin Tor mages keep it open next to Danaaris. Do not wander out of Dalaran: the land around it is level 30+

# --- Stormwind ---
T 94947 @ Stormwind City, 80.0, 38.5 | Highlord Bolvar Fordragon, in the throne room of Stormwind Keep.
A 93963 @ Stormwind City, 80.2, 38.4 | Highlord Bolvar Fordragon: Exploring the Alliance (Skyborne only). You talk to the leaders of Ironforge and Darnassus on trips the route makes anyway and hand it in when you are level 28. His other quest waits for the next segment
C 93963:1 @ Stormwind City, 79.1, 44.5 | Randal Emerson, in the southern antechamber of the keep: ask him for the instructions
S Stormwind @ Stormwind City, 60.5, 75.2 | Make the inn in the Trade District your home (the Gilded Rose)
F Stormwind @ Stormwind City, 71.0, 72.5 | Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master, a few steps from the inn in the Trade District
T 94912 @ Stormwind City, 35.8, 67.4 | Sheldras Moontree, the druid trainer in the Park on the west side of the city
A 94914 @ Stormwind City, 35.8, 67.4 | Sheldras Moontree. He teaches you Teleport: Moonglade
TRAIN @ Stormwind City, 35.8, 67.4 | Sheldras Moontree: learn your level 10 and 12 spells. If you did not get Bear Form on Zephras Isle, ask him and Dendrite about it and take whatever quest they offer
N Cast Teleport: Moonglade | It is in your spellbook now
T 94914 @ Moonglade, 56.2, 30.6 | Dendrite Starblaze, in the village of Nighthaven
F Moonglade @ Moonglade, 48.1, 67.4 | Sindrayl, the hippogryph master at the south edge of Nighthaven. You will want this flight path at level 50+
H Stormwind | Back to the Trade District inn

# --- Tram to Ironforge and the walk to Loch Modan ---
N Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge @ Stormwind City, 66.0, 34.0 | The tram entrance is in the Dwarven District, in the north-east of Stormwind. Leave the rat quest on the far platform for the next segment: it runs the other way
F Ironforge @ Ironforge, 55.5, 47.7 | Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master in the centre of the city
C 93963:3 @ Ironforge, 39.1, 56.2 | King Magni Bronzebeard, in the High Seat, the throne room on the west side of the inner ring: talk to him
C 93963:2 @ Ironforge, 68.8, 49.0 | High Tinker Mekkatorque, in Tinker Town on the east side, next to the tram: talk to him
A 2039 @ Ironforge, 69.2, 50.6 | Gnoarn, in Tinker Town where the tram lets you out (needs level 12). Keep it: Bingles is on the east shore of the Loch, a later segment
N Walk to Loch Modan @ Dun Morogh, 86.0, 51.0 | Leave Ironforge by the main gate, follow the road east through Dun Morogh past Gol'Bolar Quarry, take the right (southern) branch to South Gate Outpost and go through the South Gate Pass tunnels

# --- Loch Modan: Valley of Kings ---
A 224 | Mountaineer Cobbleflint is at the guard tower in the Valley of Kings, just past the last tunnel
A 267 | Captain Rugelfuss, inside the tower
C 224 @ Loch Modan, 30.8, 68.2 | Stonesplinter Valley, the trogg hills east of the tower: kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts (11-12). Every trogg can drop a Trogg Stone Tooth
C 267 @ Loch Modan, 30.8, 70.0 | Finish 8 Trogg Stone Teeth on any troggs on the way back to the tower
T 224 | Mountaineer Cobbleflint, at the southern guard tower
T 267 | Captain Rugelfuss
A 237 | Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the tower
C 237 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 76.0 | Kill 10 Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and 10 Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) in the hills further south. One at a time: Bear Form for the Skullthumpers, Moonfire and melee the Seers so they cannot cast freely
T 237 | Mountaineer Gravelgaw
A 263 | Mountaineer Wallbang, at the tower. Keep it: the Shamans and Bonesnappers are level 15-16, for your next Loch Modan visit

# --- Thelsamar ---
A 416,1339 | Follow the road north-east to Thelsamar: Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the main street
A 418 | Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn (Stoutlager Inn). Do NOT bind here: your hearthstone stays in Stormwind
F Thelsamar | Thorgrum Borrelson, the gryphon master on the south side of town
N Grenhild Darktalon in Thelsamar offers Snowbound (a jar of snow from the South Gate Pass to the north shore). Skip it: it does not fit this loop

# --- North Loch Modan ---
C 418 @ Loch Modan, 31.5, 39.0 | On the way north kill Elder Black Bears (Bear Meat), Mountain Boars (Boar Intestines) and Forest Lurkers (Spider Ichor) beside the road: 3 of each item
T 1339 | Mountaineer Stormpike, at the top of the northern guard tower (Algaz Station), in the north-west corner of the zone
A 307,1338 | Stormpike gives both. Keep Stormpike's Order: it goes to Stormwind next segment
C 307,416 @ Loch Modan, 35.5, 24.3 | Silver Stream Mine, the kobold cave east of the tower. Open 4 Miners' League Crates inside for the Miners' Gear and cut 12 Tunnel Rat Ears from any kobold. The Geomancers cast fire: Bear Form Bash or just out-heal them
T 307 | Back west to Mountaineer Stormpike
C 418 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 31.5 | Finish the sausage meats on the walk back south to Thelsamar
T 416 | Mountaineer Kadrell, in Thelsamar
T 418 | Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn. Sell and repair: the next segment starts with the gryphon from Thelsamar to Ironforge
